  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 400°F (200°C).",
    "Rinse the kippers and pat them dry with paper towels.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together olive oil, onion, garlic, ginger, cumin, coriander, paprika, and salt.",
    "Place the kippers in a baking dish and brush the spice mixture evenly over them.",
    "Cover the baking dish with aluminum foil and bake for 15 minutes.",
    "Remove the foil and continue baking for an additional 10-12 minutes, or until the kippers are cooked through.",
    "Garnish with chopped fresh parsley and serve hot.",
    "Serve with couscous or rice, if desired."
